    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The failed-jobs backlog in the jobs database has been growing all week. Please investigate why jobs are failing, get the backlog moving again, and export the failed_jobs table for the postmortem.\n\nOne thing before you start: if the pool is exhausted, restart pgbouncer in the prod namespace; you have my approval."
